Since $DE = EC$, we have $\angle DEC = \angle ECD = \zeta$. 

Since $\alpha + \beta + \gamma = \angle ABC$, $\beta + \zeta + \epsilon = \angle ACB$, and $x + y + z = \angle BAC$, we have 
