$\frac{BD}{\sin x} = \frac{AD}{\sin \alpha} \implies \sin x = \frac{BD \sin \alpha}{AD}$ 
$\frac{EC}{\sin z} = \frac{AE}{\sin \gamma} \implies \sin z = \frac{EC \sin \gamma}{AE}$ 
