       \end{enumerate}
    \item We want the smallest positive angle $\theta$. 
    \item In the first case, $\theta = 9^\circ + 36n$. 
    \item Choose $n = 0$ for the smallest positive $\theta$, so $\theta = 9^\circ$. 
